            "text_intro": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Tissue culture plants are young, and the first few weeks in a new home are the part that decides everything. We think that risk should sit with us, not with you. So if a plant you bought from us doesn’t pull through within 30 days of delivery, we replace it.</p><p>There is one thing we need you to do on day one. It takes ten seconds and it is the whole reason we can offer this — see <em>What we need from you</em> below.</p>",
