            "text_not": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<ul><li>Claims with no arrival photo.</li><li>Plants that were clearly neglected — left sitting in water, put in direct sun, or grown without the humidity setup the guide asks for.</li><li>Anything outside the 30-day window.</li></ul><p>That’s the whole list. We’re not looking for reasons to say no — if you took your photo, followed the guide, and it still didn’t work out, that’s exactly what this is for.</p>",
