            "text_claim": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<ol><li><strong>Email <a href=\"mailto:info@agaplantz.com\">info@agaplantz.com</a></strong> within 30 days of delivery, with your order number in the subject line.</li><li><strong>Attach your arrival photo and your photos of the problem.</strong></li><li><strong>We reply within 24–48 hours.</strong> Once it’s approved you pay the $14.99 shipping (plus the 50% if the plant was $200 or over) and your replacement goes out with the next batch.</li></ol>",
