            "faq_1_a": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Then we can’t process a guarantee claim, and we’re sorry — it’s the one thing we can’t work around, because without it there is no way to know what condition the plant was in when it reached you. Take one the moment you open the box; a phone photo is fine. If your plant was delivered before this guarantee started, get in touch anyway and we’ll work with you.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
